#=========================================================================================
# ICsprout55 LVS general derivations
#
# Substrate region for MOS bulk terminals.
#   - p-substrate: active outside the n-well (NMOS bodies; std-cell design style).
#   - n-well: drawn NW (globally tied to VDD unless -rd no_well_ties=true).
#=========================================================================================

# p-substrate = active outside the n-well (NMOS bodies; std-cell design style)
PSUB = ACT.not(NW).not(IOWELL)
